# Take a bag a person holds by its handle, gripping the handle below their wrist.
# The arm stays at the grip: the caller confirms the release and moves it away.
# Wrist keypoint of the hand holding the handle
geometry_msgs/PointStamped hand_point
# Metres below the wrist to grip the handle; <= 0 uses the default
float32 grasp_below_hand 0.0
---
# The gripper closed on the handle
bool success
string message
---
string execution_state
